  "bodyHash": "28837927e51fa27f",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/适用于 Minecraft-1.19 | 1.18 | 1.17 | 1.16-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"386\" height=\"28\">&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安装于-仅客户端-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 简介：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Stylish Effects</strong> 彻底重构了状态效果的显示方式。提供多种模式供您选择，并拥有无数配置选项，助您打造梦寐以求的效果显示界面。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📚 内容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">首先，原本简陋的原版 HUD 效果显示已被更华丽的版本取代，其中包含效果计时器以及当前效果等级（放大器）。此显示方式现在也应用于物品栏界面，因为它更加紧凑，能在效果图标开始重叠前显示更多的效果。而且，新的物品栏显示不再局限于玩家主背包，现在您可以在任何容器内查看自己的活跃效果！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">但是等等，既然状态效果现在只显示为小巧的图标，您如何知道它们的具体名称呢？别担心，我们为此添加了便捷的提示框。当安装了 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Just Enough Effect Descriptions</strong></span></a> by <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>MehVahdJukaar</strong></span></a> is installed.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您喜欢原版物品栏的状态效果显示，并希望保留它，甚至也想在 HUD 上使用吗？没问题！您可以自由选择任意组件模式，甚至可以选择“无”。此外，还有大量可配置设置，例如效果显示在屏幕的哪一侧、行列数量、自定义透明度、文本颜色、自定义屏幕位置等，应有尽有。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 媒体：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/288/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/290/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>动态展示炫酷的效果显示</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>可选择并配置多种效果渲染类型</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/291/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/292/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>紧凑的效果显示替换了物品栏内的原版界面</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>效果显示出现在所有容器中，而不仅仅是背包</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/293/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/294/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>鼠标悬停在效果组件上时会显示实用提示</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>海量自定义选项，打造专属效果显示界面</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/295/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>出色的 JEI 和 REI 兼容性</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常见问题：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：如何在 Forge 上配置此模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>安装我的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模组，即可在游戏内直接配置！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：如何在 Fabric 上配置此模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>目前尚未实现在游戏内直接编辑配置文件的功能。相反，请在进入世界后运行 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 命令，并根据模组要求选择 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>。随后点击聊天栏中出现的文件名（以 .toml 结尾），即可在外部编辑器中手动修改配置文件。保存文件后，配置将在几秒后自动在游戏内重载，无需重启游戏。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：如何下载 1.19 之前版本的 Fabric 版模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>旧版本下载请访问 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>旧项目页面</strong></span></a>。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 鸣谢：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">《Stylish Effects》的开发过程中得到了以下启发与帮助：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/deadzoke\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Deadzoke</strong></span></a>：其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ignitehud\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ignite HUD</span></a> 模组启发了效果持续时间的显示设计</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dmitrylovin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Dmitrylovin</strong></span></a>：其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-hud-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Inventory HUD+</span></a> 模组启发了紧凑的效果等级显示设计</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mag_icus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mag_icus</strong></span></a>：其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/status-effect-timer\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Status Effect Timer</span></a> 模组启发了紧凑的效果持续时间显示设计</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/snownee_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Snownee</strong></span></a>：其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mini-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mini Effects</span></a> 模组提供了一种禁用 JEI 默认物品栏状态效果处理的小技巧</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&message=LunaPixelStudios&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs_&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzss&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=u/Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=reddit&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs 0212&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DCwxKZU.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/console-experience\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aXWOS7B.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTzDrbm.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sHiR309.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
